      "content": "interesting. so if i were writing this paper, how would i describe the actual impact of this transition on the neighborhood's \"quality of life\" or \"safety\"? like, does the shift in these two groups usually result in the area becoming a more \"stable\" or \"vibrant\" community, or does it just create more friction? how do sociologists typically frame the change in the local culture and atmosphere?",
